    <p>The business delivered solid growth in 2024 with revenue up <strong>{yoy_revenue_growth:.1f}%</strong> and profit up <strong>{yoy_profit_growth:.1f}%</strong> year-over-year. Profit margins held steady at ~40%, indicating effective cost management despite promotional activity.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SALES TRENDS -->
<section class="section" id="sales-trends">
