    <h4>Trend Insights</h4>
    <p>Revenue peaked in <strong>{peak_month['year_month']}</strong> (${peak_month['revenue']:,.0f}) and troughed in <strong>{low_month['year_month']}</strong> (${low_month['revenue']:,.0f}). Seasonal patterns show strongest performance in January and July, suggesting holiday and mid-year promotional effects. Q2 2024 was the strongest quarter on record.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRODUCT PERFORMANCE -->
<section class="section" id="product-performance">
  <h2>Product &amp; Category Performance</h2>
  <p class="lead">Top-performing products by revenue and profit contribution. <em>Note: Product dimension tables (category, brand, cocoa%) are not included in the provided dataset; analysis is based on product_id.</em></p>

