  <h2>Customer Behavior &amp; Loyalty Insights</h2>
  <p class="lead">Purchasing patterns segmented by order frequency and customer value. <em>Note: Customer dimension tables (age, gender, loyalty status) are not included in the provided dataset; analysis is based on transaction behavior.</em></p>

  <div class="chart-grid">
